Spec: SpecDD Path Resolver

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Resolve SpecDD path and glob candidates against a project root and spec directory.

Owns:
  SpecDDPathResolver.kt

Can modify:
  SpecDDPathResolver.kt

Can read:
  ../../../../../../test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/references/SpecDDPathResolverBehaviorSpec.kt

Must:
  Resolve exact path candidates relative to the containing spec file directory.
  Resolve glob candidates relative to the containing spec file directory.
  Return matching existing files and directories.
  Keep all returned targets inside the project root.
  Return ignored status for unresolved candidates without path syntax.
  Return unresolved status for unresolved candidates with path syntax.
  Normalize relative path segments before checking containment.
  Treat malformed glob patterns as unresolved.
  Cap glob resolution results.
  Skip common heavy directories while walking the project tree.
  Continue resolution when an unreadable file or directory is encountered while walking the project tree.

Must not:
  Read or modify file contents.
  Create IntelliJ PSI references.
  Report diagnostics.
